## Gym Layout & Mapping Log (B1F Tileset Collision Glitch)
- **Visual Appearance:** The Gym uses the same tileset as Pokémon Mansion, so the floor appears as pink-white checkerboard tiles, and walls appear as stone blocks/tables.
- **Glitch Warning:** Walking on the pink-white checkerboard floor tiles inside the Gym triggers wild encounters from the last loaded map's encounter table (which was the Pokémon Mansion B1F!). This is a standard retail Gen 1 tileset collision glitch and is NOT a ROM hack. Simply run from wild encounters (Ponyta, Vulpix, Muk, etc.).

